      "created_at": "2016-03-01T19:14:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>\"Licensing\" the game means GtG won't be making any changes to the game, right? &nbsp;There's just one review of the game on BGG which makes it sound fine but not stellar (heh). &nbsp;Wonder if GtG will be making changes to shore up the parts of the game which don't shine.</p><p>Also, the reviewer mentions the game is \"fiddly\". &nbsp;Wonder if that's what made GtG think it would be a good match for them? &nbsp;I keed, I keed!</p>",
